## Service Responsibilities

- Validate basic input
- Execute business logic
- Orchestrate transactions within a **single** data-store boundary
- Log important business events via `IKafkaLogger`
- Convert Provider results into response models

---

## Hard Constraints — MUST NOT

| Forbidden | Alternative |
|-----------|-------------|
| Write raw SQL directly | Use Provider in Infrastructure |
| Call external HTTP with raw `HttpClient` | Use Provider wrapping `IRestfulClient` |
| Use forbidden libraries (`Dapper`, `EF`, `AutoMapper`, etc.) | Use ECCore abstractions |
| Implement distributed transactions across resources | Use DB stored procedures |
| Inject or depend on another Service | Refactor to shared Provider or SP |

```csharp
// Correct — Services are independent
public class MemberService { public void CreateMember() { ... } }
public class GameService   { public void CreateGame()   { ... } }

// Wrong — Service injecting another Service
public class MemberService
{
    private readonly GameService _gameService; // FORBIDDEN
    public MemberService(GameService gameService) { ... }
}
```

